 328 000264  3045          DCA CHARSW      /RESET UNPACK SWITCH
 329 000265  4562          JMS I ODGETI    /GET WORD
 330 000266  4670          JMS I OMODPT    /OUTPUT IN DESIRED FORMAT
 331 000267  5246          JMP SLO2        /AND GO REOPEN.
