2537               /+++    FOR SCOPE OPERATION, RUBOUTS CAUSE OUTPUT OF THE
2538               /+++    SEQUENCE BACKSPACE, SPACE, BACKSPACE TO CLEAR THE
2539               /+++    PREVIOUS CHARACTER FROM THE SCREEN.  IF "SCOPE
2540               /+++    MODE" IS SET, RUBO IS OVERLAID ON STARTUP.
