2542               /***    FOR BATCH OPERATION, RUBOUTS ARE IGNORED BY 'RKEY'
2543               /***    AND 'RUBO' IS OVERLAID WITH CODE TO IGNORE A LINE-
2544               /***    FEED THAT FOLLOWS A CARRIAGE-RETURN.
